      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5963414363385132841",
      "content": "When you start the game you can pick a difficulty level, which can be easy, normal, or hard. \n[list]\n[*] [b]Hard[/b] is the original difficulty with several additional threats added. \n[*] [b]Normal[/b] has additional support platforms. \n[*] [b]Easy[/b] has additional respawn points, which look like green checkpoints. Just to let you know, they are not checkpoints, to save your progress you need to reach a blue checkpoint.   \n[/list]\n",
      "key": "2655800::810280be0731a80afb25cc9bf28ac0728be614c1",
      "tags": null
    },
